## 🔐 SSL & TLS Basics

I also learned the basics of **SSL/TLS** and how encryption is used to secure communication between systems.

One important example is **HTTPS**, which uses TLS to protect web traffic.

## 💡 Key Takeaway

I'm starting to understand that when performing network enumeration, an open port is not simply a number.

**Open Port → Service → Version → Possible Attack Surface**

This knowledge will help me better understand **Nmap scans, network enumeration, and penetration testing** as I continue practicing.

